Use complete books and courses as the sustained reading, then return to precise methods and primary research for particular claims. Each source Record identifies the work, an authorized external entrance, reading scope, edition and access conditions. No book, article, course media, external dataset or third-party software is bundled here.

**Complete introductory and classical books:** [Introduction to Engineering Thermodynamics — Claire Yu Yan](sources/Introduction-to-Engineering-Thermodynamics-Yan.lingua#r_6AX93SRMGE0XXJTQ1NW6X9QXTW) · [Engineering Thermodynamics — Olivier Cleynen](sources/Engineering-Thermodynamics-Cleynen.lingua#r_38CM7HKS0GSN5T09YDXFKHRVGQ) · [Thermodynamics and Chemistry — Howard DeVoe](sources/Thermodynamics-and-Chemistry-DeVoe.lingua#r_2YHHGY26Y8X9MS9DB3MXZHD1D1) · [Termodinâmica — Bernhard Lesche, UFJF](sources/Termodinamica-Lesche-UFJF.lingua#r_0ABCKSRZBN8T4Y4FV1FQPWNY4Z) · [A Heat Transfer Textbook — Lienhard and Lienhard](sources/A-Heat-Transfer-Textbook-Lienhard.lingua#r_7TKQ2D5YRNQ8XVHXNJQDRANWKD).

